<section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">

  <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-heritage-dark-brown">
    Kisah di Balik Sendang
  </h2>

  <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-heritage-deep-brown/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
    Temukan narasi manuskrip digital mengenai asal-usul, nilai spiritualitas, dan kearifan lokal yang mengiringi keberadaan Sendang Ngampel Wetan.
  </p>

  <div class="my-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-heritage-warm-cream/40 border border-heritage-light-brown/20 max-w-xl mx-auto">
