    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base font-serif italic text-heritage-warm-brown">
      "Kisah tutur mengenai perintisan Mbah Koso (~498 M) dan tirakat Sunan Ampel yang memancarkan mata air wudhu Sendang Ngampel..."
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6">
    <a
      href="/legenda"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-heritage-dark-brown text-heritage-warm-cream hover:bg-heritage-warm-brown transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl border border-heritage-gold-accent/40 text-base font-medium group"
    >
      <span>Baca Kisah Lengkap Legenda</span>
      <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
